    "summary": "The user asks for a summary of the vaccine mandate debate, moving from a general overview to a specific inquiry about whether there was a scientific debate regarding efficacy. The assistant initially presents a balanced view of the policy debate but shifts into a non-neutral, dismissive stance in the final turn when challenged on the existence of scientific dissent.",
